    -- ── Fyodor Dostoevsky ─────────────────────────────────────────
    (
        'Crime and Punishment', NULL,
        'Raskolnikov, a destitute and desperate former student, wanders through the '
        'slums of St. Petersburg and commits a random murder. The act tears at his '
        'sanity as an investigator closes in. A novel of the psychology of guilt.',
