    ),
    (
        'The Brothers Karamazov', NULL,
        'The final novel by Fyodor Dostoevsky. The story tells of the Karamazov family: '
        'the sensual, impulsive father Fyodor Pavlovich, and his three very different '
        'sons. Beneath the story of a family feud lies a profound meditation on God, '
        'free will, and morality.',
